{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ② 조건·반복·리스트","level":2,"title":"범위 안으로 맞추기","desc":"<p><code>x</code>가 <code>lo</code>보다 작으면 <code>lo</code>를, <code>hi</code>보다 크면 <code>hi</code>를, 그 사이면 <code>x</code>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>clamp(x, lo, hi)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def clamp(x, lo, hi):\n    pass\n","solution":"def clamp(x, lo, hi):\n    if x < lo:\n        return lo\n    if x > hi:\n        return hi\n    return x\n","hint":"<p><code>if</code>를 두 번 쓰고, 둘 다 아니면 <code>x</code>를 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"clamp(5, 0, 10)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"clamp(-3, 0, 10)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"clamp(99, 0, 10)","expected":10,"visible":false},{"call":"clamp(0, 0, 10)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"clamp(10, 0, 10)","expected":10,"visible":false}],"id":"py-283"}